-- title:
--   A Gauss-type unramified valuation on the X_H(N) function field
-- statement:
--   Let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, let $k_0$ be an intermediate field of $\mathbb Q \subseteq \overline{\mathbb Q}$ and let $\pi_0 \in k_0$ have image in $A$; write $A_0$ for the valuation subring $A$ pulled back along $k_0 \to \overline{\mathbb Q}$, and assume $A_0$ is a discrete valuation ring whose maximal ideal is generated by $\pi_0$. Let $N$ be a natural number, $H$ a subgroup of $(\mathbb Z/N)^\times$, and let $K''$ be the intermediate field of $k_0 \subseteq k_0(\!(q)\!)$ equal to `laurentBaseChange`, that is, the field generated over $k_0$ by the coefficientwise images under `coeffEmb` of the $q$-expansion function field `xHFunctionField N H` $\subseteq \mathbb Q(\!(q)\!)$; $K''$ carries an $A_0$-algebra structure compatible with $A_0 \to k_0 \to K''$. Let $j''\in K''$ have underlying Laurent series the coefficientwise image of `jq`, the $q$-expansion $q^{-1}\cdot(\text{power series})$ of $j$. Then there exists a valuation subring $V$ of $K''$ such that: the image of every element of $A_0$ lies in $V$; the image of $\pi_0$ is a non-unit of $V$; for every polynomial $P$ over $A_0$ with $\pi_0 \nmid P$, both $P(j'')$ and $P(j'')^{-1}$ lie in $V$; and every non-unit $f$ of $V$ satisfies $f\pi_0^{-1} \in V$.
--
--   This is the existence of the coefficientwise (Gauss) valuation on the $q$-expansion function field of $X_H(N)$ over a small constant field: it extends $A_0$, has the same uniformiser $\pi_0$ (so is unramified over $A_0$), and is of Gauss type with respect to $j''$, in the sense that every polynomial in $j''$ over $A_0$ with a unit coefficient is a unit. It is obtained from a regular prolongation for the group $\Gamma_H(N)$, which contains the translation $T$, together with the transcendence of the reduced $q$-expansion of $j$, and it feeds the analysis of minimal primes over $\pi_0$ in the chart algebras of $X_H(N)$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_valuationSubring_gaussType_unramified_laurentBaseChange_xHFunctionField.lean

